    "description": "Welcome to \"Driving School Simulator\", a true car driving simulator where you can experience the thrill of driving in a variety of open world maps with over 150+  realistic and detailed cars.\r\n\r\nGet behind the wheel of your favorite car and drive it in one of the most important cities in the world. \r\nUnique in the car games niche, Driving School Simulator has all the elements that you are searching for\u2026.Car collection, City maps, Highway, Customizations, Multiplayer, Drag Race, Challenges, City Driving, Free. It goes on and on. Stop reading, just download now!\r\n\r\nIn this car simulator , you can learn how to legally drive,  participate in street racing,drag racing or invite a friend and drive around the city together.\r\n\r\n\r\nGAMEPLAY\r\n\r\nIn this game, you will learn all the traffic signs and regulations while driving your favorite car.You will be required to stop at stop signs, give way to pedestrians, cyclists, cars, and drive safely while obeying traffic rules.\r\n\r\nMAPS\r\n\r\nWith several open world maps to choose from you can drive your car in the city, on the highway or just cruising on long roads. You can choose between Paris, Las Vegas, Sydney, Washington, Rome, Moscow, Route 66 , etc\r\n\r\nMULTIPLAYER\r\n\r\nPlay with your friends in the new Online Multiplayer mode or Race against them. You can create a friends list, chat with them and for sure, race them all ! Challenge your friends in multiple modes available like drag racing, chase mode or street car racing.\r\n\r\nTUNING\r\n\r\nThis car game has more than 150 vehicles to drive. You can choose from sports cars, SUVs, Offroad cars, Sedans, Supercars, Hypercars and Hatchbacks!\r\nYou can modify suspension and camber adjustments to improve vehicle handling and appearance or upgrade your car performance to win all the races! Detailed vehicle interiors with customizable ambient lighting await your personal touch.\r\n\r\nDRIVE\r\n\r\nThe game's realistic graphics and sound effects make you feel like you're really behind the wheel of a car. You'll feel the engine roar, the tires squeal, and the wind rushing by as you speed down the road. Choose from manual or auto transmission mode and pass the driving exams! \r\n\r\nDriving School Simulator is the ultimate driving simulator that offers both entertainment and education. Complete the driving academy to earn your driving license or engage in races with your friends!\r\n\r\nDriving School Simulator is the ultimate car game simulator you won't want to miss! Download it now for free!\r\n________________________________________________________________________ \r\n- Official website: https://www.ovilex.com/ \r\n- TikTok : https://www.tiktok.com/@ovilexsoftware \r\n- Follow us on Youtube: https://www.youtube.com/@OviLexSoft \r\n- Follow us on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/OvilexSoftware",
